{"availability":"available","full":"Colin97/Point2Mesh","name":"Point2Mesh","description":"Meshing Point Clouds with Predicted Intrinsic-Extrinsic Ratio Guidance (ECCV2020)","category":"Education","language":"C++","stars":98,"forks":12,"created":"2020-08-10T23:24:59Z","updated":"2020-10-28T20:47:51Z","license":"MIT","branch":"master","homepage":"","topics":["3d","3d-deep-learning","3d-reconstruction","eccv2020","geodesic-distances","mesh","mesh-generation","mesh-processing","neural-network","point-cloud","pointclouds","remeshing"],"demo":"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1Wb-mU3mcxpKAQyb7LqqQYKbfnpmDXSiZ?usp=sharing","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-18T18:17:04.206Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-18T18:17:04.206Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-18T18:17:04.206Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-09T08:59:06.130Z","stars":98,"forks":12},{"at":"2026-10-12T11:43:02.968Z","stars":98,"forks":12},{"at":"2026-10-18T18:17:04.206Z","stars":98,"forks":12}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Codes for Meshing Point Clouds with Predicted Intrinsic-Extrinsic Ratio Guidance (ECCV2020). [paper]","We propose a novel mesh reconstruction method that leverages the input point cloud as much as possible, by predicting which triplets of points should form faces. Our key innovation is a surrogate of local connectivity, calculated by comparing the intrinsic/extrinsic metrics. We learn to classify the candidate triangles using a deep network and then feed the results to a post-processing module for mesh generation. Our method can not only preserve fine-grained details, handle ambiguous structures, but also possess strong generalizability to unseen categories."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Colin97/Point2Mesh/blob/master/README.md","fingerprint":"1b595ce8bc45ba6bfc5ab64e84711b692feaaf1a0124a8276260c398366cb7fa","extractedAt":"2026-10-09T08:59:06.278Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-09T08:59:06.278Z","projectInsights":{"vers